                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f57a750d-44d8-380c-ba6d-bcfeb83baa6d",
                        "entry_id": "6d4fcfc5-768b-3e03-92cf-b6c723f60a45",
                        "glosses": [
                            "у индейцев Северной Америки и некоторых других народов — лодка, гребля на которой обычно осуществляется лопатообразным однолопастным веслом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30061d62-5597-4e87-91e0-891944079819",
                                "sense_id": "f57a750d-44d8-380c-ba6d-bcfeb83baa6d",
                                "text": "Снарядив два корабля, он приплыл на Багамы и вместе с ныряльщиками-индейцами на каноэ начал планомерное обследование коралловых рифов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85983e03-122c-4874-b454-f780acebb6e4",
                                "sense_id": "f57a750d-44d8-380c-ba6d-bcfeb83baa6d",
                                "text": "Некоторые индейские племена вместо рытья могилы снаряжали каноэ и, проводив умершего ритуальными песнопениями, клали в лодку, отправляя в «последнее путешествие»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f98c11ab-215c-36e5-acac-8e3db09aa04a",
                        "entry_id": "6d4fcfc5-768b-3e03-92cf-b6c723f60a45",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спорт. лёгкая спортивная лодка, каждый гребец на которой действует одним коротким свободным веслом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51354566-ef9d-4f8e-ab52-b6b5474fba69",
                                "sense_id": "f98c11ab-215c-36e5-acac-8e3db09aa04a",
                                "text": "Для отработки приемов гребного слалома наиболее удобны спортивные слаломные байдарки и каноэ или туристские байдарки."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b516044-efb0-40eb-837d-aba8a045804c",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d4fcfc5-768b-3e03-92cf-b6c723f60a45",
                        "target_lang_word": "canoe",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "canoe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bed7846c-b2f6-3e8c-ba1d-c7df98b4b466",
                                        "entry_id": "764ffbf0-7302-321c-9fa0-d82d8ecb950a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small long and narrow boat, propelled by one or more people (depending on the size of canoe), using single-bladed paddles. The paddlers face in the direction of travel, in either a seated position, or kneeling on the bottom of the boat. Canoes are open on top, and pointed at both ends."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7794e134-f03f-451d-9f85-8b9c2cbf97c6",
                                                "sense_id": "bed7846c-b2f6-3e8c-ba1d-c7df98b4b466",
                                                "text": "The canoe is of pure black oak, and is in excellent preservation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "725bac0e-7b67-46de-aa62-8fc1fcc95004",
                                                "sense_id": "bed7846c-b2f6-3e8c-ba1d-c7df98b4b466",
                                                "text": "He and Gerald usually challenged the rollers in a sponson canoe when Gerald was there for the weekend; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca51003b-f535-404f-b2c5-5e01768649b3",
                                                "sense_id": "bed7846c-b2f6-3e8c-ba1d-c7df98b4b466",
                                                "text": "His program also included a survey of the new course of the lower Tarim river in Eastern Turkistan and its terminal lake Lop-nor. This part of the expedition started in April 1934, from Könche or Yü-li-hsien, a small village about 45 km. SSE of Korla, whence Dr. Hedin followed the river Könche-darya and its continuation Qum-darya, travelling in native canoes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f405dac-49c7-3e8a-8f92-2c47452d46be",
                                        "entry_id": "764ffbf0-7302-321c-9fa0-d82d8ecb950a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An oversize, usually older, luxury car."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f65620c-a848-33eb-b1d7-208e63191c79",
                                        "entry_id": "764ffbf0-7302-321c-9fa0-d82d8ecb950a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of the deflectors positioned around a roulette wheel, shaped like upside-down boats."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "canoe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18c7f7ea-fa09-3fc4-babd-13e682cef303",
                                        "entry_id": "1df1af20-f3ae-31b0-997c-33a536a1b4ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To ride or paddle a canoe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "334f053e-d2b7-494e-a2ef-6540fbf7d989",
                                                "sense_id": "18c7f7ea-fa09-3fc4-babd-13e682cef303",
                                                "text": "Car drivers were helicoptered to safety from nearby roads. There were photographs of people canoeing down streets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "09600666-44ae-4dc5-b12f-ba2409656299",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d4fcfc5-768b-3e03-92cf-b6c723f60a45",
                        "target_lang_word": "canoë",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "canoë",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d5d7f6e-b698-310c-9603-e26ca3738a39",
                                        "entry_id": "9056083d-1d41-381e-9e5a-8fb760040689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de pirogue originaire des peuples d’Amérique du nord dans laquelle un ou plusieurs utilisateurs propulsent le bateau à l’aide d’une pagaie à une pale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Navigation",
                                            "Canoë-kayak"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a25f0a5-f8b4-4657-897f-7a2553d8f3b2",
                                                "sense_id": "6d5d7f6e-b698-310c-9603-e26ca3738a39",
                                                "text": "Le canoë a remis en honneur les rivières de France abandonnées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0b2ac7a-2741-3d11-8742-06f879be0098",
                                        "entry_id": "9056083d-1d41-381e-9e5a-8fb760040689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sport nautique qui se pratique avec cette embarcation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c903d3c1-13ac-4600-a2d1-b06433cd2f33",
                                                "sense_id": "c0b2ac7a-2741-3d11-8742-06f879be0098",
                                                "text": "Nous proposons des activités nautiques en canoë, kayak, raft, pour le loisir et la compétition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
